  "aggregation_rules": [
    "Only model-visible workflow_counts from the two disjoint UTC windows are added. Tool calls, fragments, input bytes and output bytes are separate quantities.",
    "Missing workflow categories are rendered as zero observed calls for each provider; this does not establish zero real-world activity or coverage completeness.",
    "Workflow categories are coarse analyzer labels. Call frequency and output bytes are neither wasted tokens nor intervention-eligible tasks.",
    "Skill workflow mappings overlap. Never add per-skill totals; fetch/research share web research and triage shares diff/research proxies.",
    "Nested Codex completed-command telemetry overlaps the model-visible view and is reported separately, never added.",
    "Session groups and provider usage counters are not summed across providers or interpreted as comparable user-task counts. Cached/reasoning tokens and cumulative snapshots are not added to primary token totals.",
    "No raw transcript content, identifiers, private paths or historical commands are included."
  ],
